CashCore - delta\\(Object sourceJSON, Object dirtyJSON, Object additionalParams\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/LeadToCashCoreAPI.md","line":37},{"title":"LeadtoCashCore - effect\\(Object sourceJSON, Object targetJSON, Object additionalParams\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/LeadToCashCoreAPI.md","line":38},{"title":"LeadtoCashCore - commitInstance\\(Object targetJSON, Object additionalParams\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/LeadToCashCoreAPI.md","line":39},{"title":"LeadtoCashCore - getPrimitivesEPService\\(String sourceToTargetConfigID, Object context\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/LeadToCashCoreAPI.md","line":45},{"title":"Server API reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/api-server.md","line":86},{"title":"LeadtoCashCore - getPrimitivesEPService\\(String sourceToTargetConfigID, Object context\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/LeadToCashCoreAPI.md","line":221},{"title":"LeadtoCashCore - getPrimitivesEPService\\(String sourceToTargetConfigID, Object context\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/LeadToCashCoreAPI.md","line":229},{"title":"LeadtoCashCore - getPrimitivesEPService\\(String sourceToTargetConfigID, Object context\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/LeadToCashCoreAPI.md","line":344},{"title":"LeadtoCashCore - getPrimitivesEPService\\(String sourceToTargetConfigID, Object context\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/LeadToCashCoreAPI.md","line":375},{"title":"LeadtoCashCore - getPrimitivesEPService\\(String sourceToTargetConfigID, Object context\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/LeadToCashCoreAPI.md","line":1296},{"title":"LeadtoCashCore - createInstance\\(String headerSysIDs, String lineSysIDs, Boolean isTarget, Object additionalParams\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/LeadToCashCoreAPI.md","line":1322},{"title":"LeadtoCashCore - getPrimitivesEPService\\(String sourceToTargetConfigID, Object context\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/LeadToCashCoreAPI.md","line":1880},{"title":"LeadtoCashCore - createInstance\\(String headerSysIDs, String lineSysIDs, Boolean isTarget, Object additionalParams\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/LeadToCashCoreAPI.md","line":1904},{"title":"INSERT","target":"r_Insert","line":1984},{"title":"UPDATE","target":"r_Update","line":1986},{"title":"LeadtoCashCore - getPrimitivesEPService\\(String sourceToTargetConfigID, Object context\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/LeadToCashCoreAPI.md","line":2525},{"title":"effect\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/LeadToCashCoreAPI.md","line":2551},{"title":"Script includes","target":"c_ScriptIncludes","line":3493},{"title":"insert","target":"r_Insert","line":3494},{"title":"update","target":"r_Update","line":3495}],"metadata":{"title":"LeadtoCashCore - Scoped","description":"The LeadtoCashCore script include provides methods to orchestrate a lead-to-cash workflow in the Lead to Cash Core life cycle.Triggers the PrimitiveUtil\\(\\) utility method.Returns the data of one or more given entities with a JSON object containing various details such as header, lines, child lines, characteristics, and their attributes.Compares the source and modified source JSON objects of a lead to cash entity and returns a JSON object that describes any changes made to the source JSON, such as any additions, deletions, or modifications.Transforms and applies the source JSON structure of a given entity to the target JSON of another entity. You can then commit the changed entity to the database using the commitInstance\\(\\) method.Commits the JSON of a given lead to cash entity to the instance, returns a status message with updated information, and updates the Lead to Cash Core Entity table as a result.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/LeadToCashCoreAPI.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":47,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[51,77],[122,191],[198,202],[211,291],[296,330],[332,396],[417,442],[450,460],[464,476],[496,500],[526,535],[548,562],[575,589],[609,613],[639,650],[678,692],[714,732],[740,750],[754,772],[776,802],[813,823],[827,848],[862,866],[931,937],[956,960],[1039,1045],[1064,1068],[1137,1143],[1153,1157],[1259,1265],[1281,1285],[1290,1362],[1376,1380],[1416,1420],[1430,1441],[1466,1470],[1480,1486],[1504,1508],[1526,1534],[1544,1549],[1559,1563